{"message":"Your identity is verified, and I found no prior referrals on file. Based on the documented programs, the best fit for her startup is the Sky Blue business checking referral: you could earn $150, and she could receive a $250 welcome bonus. Sky Blue’s setup information lists a funding requirement of $0 and is intended for startups within four years of formation.

The $31,000 deposit would not meet the higher-deposit programs: Navy Blue requires $5,000 and pays you $100; True Blue requires $50,000 and pays $350; Beige requires $100,000 and pays $500. Therefore, Sky Blue offers the largest documented bonus compatible with the stated funding amount.

Before relying on the referral, she must be a new Rho-Bank customer, have no Rho-Bank account closed within the past 12 months, and have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account. Only one referral code can be used, and referral bonuses cannot be combined with another new-account promotion. The general terms also require you to satisfy the applicable checking-customer tenure threshold; the Sky Blue document does not state that threshold, so I cannot confirm that part from the available account records. Use your official referral channel or contact your relationship manager before she applies so the referral is properly attributed."}
